{"t":1793783359424,"lane":"1","type":"agent.say","text":"I booked the ferry tickets and paid only after you said yes on the card. The booking reference is **HL-WUTZUP**.\n\n- **Trip:** Saturday 7 November. You leave the Gateway of India at 09:30 and reach Elephanta at 10:30. You come back on the 14:00 sailing, arriving 15:00.\n- **Upper deck:** 3.20 USDC a person, under your 4 USDC limit. Seats are Asha Rao U15, Leo Marin U16, Mei Tan U17 and Sam Okoye U18.\n- **Boarding:** Gateway jetty 4, the step-free one, with help boarding for Sam (no charge).\n- **Total:** 12.80 USDC on the Arbitrum Sepolia test network, so no real money moved. Transaction: `0x11cb380b741d49e5777f5f9acf712925196e867609c0779ffe2ed875ceb058fe`\n- **Cancellation:** free until Friday 6 November at 18:00, refunded to the same wallet.\n\n**Return time:** I read \"back after 14:00\" as the 14:00 return. If you meant a later boat, the next one leaves at 15:30 and has upper deck seats left. You can cancel and rebook for free before the Friday deadline.\n\n**Departure time:** I picked 09:30 because the 09:00 upper deck was sold out and the 10:00 had only 2 upper deck seats left."}
